<title>NOVA Project Features</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
  h1 { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #34495e; padding-bottom: 5px; }
  h2 { color: #34495e; margin-top: 20px; }
