<body>

<h1>NOVA E-Commerce Platform - Integrated Features Report</h1>
<p><strong>Date:</strong> October 2026</p>
<p><strong>Project:</strong> NOVA (Modern E-commerce App & Admin Panel)</p>
<hr>

<h2>1. Authentication & Security</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>JWT Based Login:</strong> Secure Admin Panel authentication using JSON Web Tokens.</li>
  <li><strong>Password Hashing:</strong> Passwords are encrypted before database storage.</li>
  <li><strong>Protected Routes:</strong> Middleware integration to prevent unauthorized access to backend APIs.</li>
  <li><strong>Smart Redirects:</strong> Auto-redirect unauthenticated users to the <code>/login</code> page.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Premium Admin UI & Aesthetic (Glassmorphism)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Dark Theme Design:</strong> Custom global CSS variables for a premium, sleek dark aesthetic.</li>
  <li><strong>Glassmorphism Layout:</strong> Utilized <code>backdrop-filter: blur(20px)</code> and semi-transparent backgrounds for cards and sidebars.</li>
  <li><strong>Interactive Elements:</strong> Ghost buttons, hover transitions, and custom animated scrollbars.</li>
  <li><strong>Responsive Dashboard:</strong> A sticky top bar with organized navigation (Orders, Products, Inventory, Customers).</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Database & Architecture (SQLite)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Schema Design:</strong> Fully relational database mapping for Products, Orders, Order Items, Customers, and Admins.</li>
  <li><strong>State & Tracking:</strong> Shipping states and complex order tracking workflows.</li>
  <li><strong>Auto-Seeding:</strong> Created a custom <code>seed_db.js</code> script to quickly populate the database with realistic dummy products and orders for testing.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Order Management System</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Order Filtering:</strong> Dynamic segmentation by status (All, Unfulfilled, Processing, Completed, Cancelled).</li>
  <li><strong>Order Detail View:</strong> Granular view of purchased items, pricing breakdown, customer details, and shipping address.</li>
  <li><strong>Fulfillment Actions:</strong> Ability to mark orders as shipped and add optional tracking numbers.</li>
  <li><strong>Print Invoice:</strong> A dedicated, print-friendly invoice layout. When clicking "Print Invoice", all admin UI elements are hidden, presenting a clean, professional, branded bill-to/ship-to PDF format.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Data Export & Analytics</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>CSV Export for Orders:</strong> Export fully formatted order tables directly to <code>nova_orders.csv</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>CSV Export for Customers:</strong> Export customer CRM data to <code>nova_customers.csv</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Excel Compatibility:</strong> Implemented UTF-8 BOM (<code>\uFEFF</code>) encoding and raw number formatting to ensure seamless compatibility with Microsoft Excel (fixing Indian Rupee symbol encoding and date format issues).</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Customer Relationship Management (CRM)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Customer Consolidation:</strong> Automatic grouping of orders by email to calculate a customer's Lifetime Value (LTV) and Total Orders.</li>
  <li><strong>Dynamic Search:</strong> Real-time filtering of customers by Name or Email address.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. System Robustness & API</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Error Handling:</strong> Custom API interceptor logic to gracefully handle 401 Unauthorized and 500 Internal Server Error responses.</li>
  <li><strong>Modular Backend:</strong> Express.js routing architecture divided into specific modules (auth, products, orders, customers).</li>
</ul>

</body>
</html>
